      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of headaches with recurrent paralysis of cranial nerves III, IV, V and VI is reported. A good therapeutic effect was obtained with corticoids. After ruling out other diseases and causes of ophthalmoplegia the Tolosa-Hunt syndrome was diagnosed."},
